  "content": {
    "id": "p29-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": {
      "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
      "version": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p29-q7-definition-paragraph",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 1,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A mortgage is a bank loan taken out to purchase a property in which the property acts as collateral. Interest accrues on the loan and regular (usually monthly) payments are made over some predetermined period of time. The payment amount is calculated to ensure that at the end of the time period, the loan is completely paid off. Denote the monthly payment amount by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "M",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", the annual interest rate by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "r",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "%, the initial loan amount by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "P_0",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", and the balance owing on the loan after ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "n",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " months by ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "P_n",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ".",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p29-q7-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Determine a formula for $P_n$ in terms of $M$, $r$, $P_0$ and $n$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$$P_n=P_0\\left(1+\\frac{r}{1200}\\right)^n-M\\frac{\\left(1+\\frac{r}{1200}\\right)^n-1}{r/1200}.$$\n\nAccumulate monthly interest and subtract the geometric series of repayments.",
          "worked": "Let $q=1+\\frac{r}{1200}$, the monthly interest multiplier. Interest is added before each monthly repayment.\n$$\\begin{align*}P_1&=P_0q-M\\\\P_2&=(P_0q-M)q-M\\\\P_2&=P_0q^2-M(1+q)\\\\P_3&=P_0q^3-M(1+q+q^2)\\\\P_n&=P_0q^n-M(1+q+\\cdots+q^{n-1})\\\\P_n&=P_0q^n-M\\frac{q^n-1}{q-1}\\\\P_n&=P_0\\left(1+\\frac{r}{1200}\\right)^n-M\\frac{\\left(1+\\frac{r}{1200}\\right)^n-1}{r/1200}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 72
      },
      {
        "id": "p29-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Hence, determine a formula for $M$ in terms of $r$, $P_0$ and $n$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$$M=\\frac{(r/1200)P_0}{1-\\left(1+\\frac{r}{1200}\\right)^{-n}}.$$\n\nSet the balance after the final repayment to zero and rearrange.",
          "worked": "The loan is fully repaid after $n$ months, so $P_n=0$. Using $q=1+\\frac{r}{1200}$,\n$$\\begin{align*}0&=P_0q^n-M\\frac{q^n-1}{q-1}\\\\M\\frac{q^n-1}{q-1}&=P_0q^n\\\\M&=\\frac{P_0(q-1)q^n}{q^n-1}\\\\M&=\\frac{P_0(q-1)}{1-q^{-n}}\\\\M&=\\frac{(r/1200)P_0}{1-\\left(1+\\frac{r}{1200}\\right)^{-n}}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 49
      }
    ]
  },
